    "L4 analog permeability data are not direct systemic-F measurements.",
    "Species-specific low F values in L2 are not resolved for the query.",
    "No formulation, dose, or species condition is specified for the query."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "L4 shows essentially complete intestinal absorption for disopyramide and high permeability for close structural analogs, supporting the absorption component and strengthening the prior high prediction. Human L1 disopyramide F of 0.78 to 0.85 remains the primary endpoint evidence, and no affirmative threshold-relevant evidence supports F below 20%."
}

